<title>USA: Sawtek Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Sawtek Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>SAWTEK INC.</p>
<p>			Consolidated Statements of Income (Loss)</p>
<p>			   Quarter Ended</p>
<p>				    September 30,	    Year Ended</p>
<p>				     (unaudited)	  September 30,</p>
<p>				    1996     1995	  1996    1995</p>
<p>				(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p> Net sales		    $18,000 $11,550     $57,664 $31,317</p>
